      "derivation": [
        "kappa_x(inf) = 1：Hardy-Littlewood（由 unit 的归一化定义直接成立）。",
        "kappa_w(inf) = (log 2)^2：B(N) ~ (log 2) N/log N，因为 sum_{N^{1/3}<p<=sqrt N} 1/(p(1-u_p)) -> int_{1/3}^{1/2} du/(u(1-u)) = [ln(u/(1-u))]_{1/3}^{1/2} = ln 2；而局部修正 prod_p R_p -> 1。",
        "故 kappa_1(inf) = (log 2)^2 - 1 = -0.5195 < 0。"
      ]
    },
